stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Closed: At rest (V = -70 mV)

    state "Na+ Channel States" as NaCh {
        Closed --> Open: Depolarisation above threshold\nm gates open (tau ~0.5 ms)\n3 activation gates (m³)
        Open --> Inactivated: h gate closes (tau ~5 ms)\nBall-and-chain mechanism\nChannel blocked from inside
        Inactivated --> Closed: Repolarisation to rest\nh gate reopens (tau ~10 ms)\nm gates close
    }

    note right of Open
        Na+ rushes IN
        V rises toward +50 mV
        Duration: ~0.5 ms
        UPSTROKE of AP
    end note

    note right of Inactivated
        Cannot reopen regardless
        of stimulus strength
        ABSOLUTE refractory period
        Ensures unidirectional
        propagation
    end note

    note right of Closed
        Ready to fire again
        All gates reset
        Channel can be
        activated by new stimulus
    end note
